{
  "song_id": 31393,
  "title": "Kon Karne",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Darker than the East River, larger than the Empire State",
          "rhyme": "Ejt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Where the beast who guard the barbed wire gate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Is on the job—not my fate, tired of the wait",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Til the Villain bring deliverance from the dire straits",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Fire at a higher rate, why debate the liars?",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Fliers scatter, buy a plate—isolate the wires",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Try the straight pliers, if not—the vice grips",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "A real price-saver way to acquire nice whips",
          "rhyme": "ips",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "What a steal for real on wheels of steel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Stunner, a funner summer number-one meal deal-bummer",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "A bizarre phenomenon—is your armor on?",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Take your cash, Karma, or break your fast—Ramadan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Transaction drama—aw, come on, Barney",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Clack, clack—pardon me, whack rap con carne",
          "rhyme": "aRn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "He came to feed the childrens like Sally Struthers",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "After that, he's going back to Cali, where's the—(—love is—)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Wilder than the Nile, hold power like the great pyramids",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Of Giza, and stay leanin' like the tower of Pisa",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Give him something he can feel that's soft to squeeza",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Raw with the pen, and on the mic—off the hezza",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Get shot off that wide-eyed talk",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "And if he had a pot, he'd still piss on the sidewalk",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Can't take the street out the street-person",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Lookin' for the perfect beat, coercion into heat-burstin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "They couldn't spot him on the spot date",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Got the only tape that come with a free hot-plate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Whoever do get to see me sing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "With the 3 D-ring sittin' stationary like B.B. King",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Can see how it really sting, it ain't no front row",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Standing room only at the motocross stunt show",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "The ruckus ain't up to Snuffleupagus",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Me and Sub' is like the brown Smothers Brothers (My love is—)",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Vaster than the seven seas, bigger than Mount Kilimanjaro",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "If they don't know, fill 'em in tomorrow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "On the horror show, a mental note: return Bob’s record",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Swear to God, before he gets a job, he robs an Eckerd",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Blessed with a hot flow, tested it, got dough",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Invested in stress, the best to finesse an opto",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "As I reminisce, never forgot when I was very broke",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Shot the Henny straight, couldn't afford to cop the Cherry Coke",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Or should I say, broke with wealth?",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "To know enough to give them just enough rope to yoke they self",
          "rhyme": "Elf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Plan B before I take the ring and pawn it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "The long arm of the law couldn't even put they fingers on it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Dog-gone it, do the statistics",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "How he bust lyrics, it's too futuristic for ballistics",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "And far too eccentric for forensics",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "I dedicate this mix to Subroc, the hip-hop Hendrix",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDDEFGHIJCKLBMNNNOOPQBBRRSSTLSSULVSWWBXYYZZZ[",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABAABBCCADEFABABCBBBGGGHBBCCIIJAIIGAGIIIBACCCCCC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "In my pocket, a note",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's—from my father",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"—from the guard's whip.\" Is this a trick?",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Why would I resort to trickery? You're already a prisoner. What do I gain by deceiving you?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You can't blame me for being suspicious",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "No",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Hehe",
          "rhyme": "af",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDDEF"
    },
